1790110949876660	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyxBA		item.create	bn-2g3ei	{"description":"After bn-20142, a parked task restores from its durable continuation record and task.status answers from durable data. A task that completed before the crash resolves to Settled, but no durable terminal TaskRecord exists, so task.status on its handle answers CapabilityDenied. Also recorded by bn-20142: a task.resume that writes a new budget and whose run then fails leaves that budget change and milestone non-durable (continuation.rs module doc); and gate_g1_06_acceptance.rs lists task.resume as a non-publisher though it publishes through verification::advance. Fix direction: publish a terminal record (or a final continuation revision carrying the terminal status) at completion, reuse the cont_ record encoding if it fits, no wire change; correct the G1-06 publisher census.","kind":"task","labels":["req:g1-08"],"title":"durable terminal task record: task.status on a Settled task after restart answers CapabilityDenied (bn-20142)"}	blake3:uHI4h22AjOt_fUeI3VWxlLlp2dmgCAGxJag_ZsdJEcs
