ates pass (boundaries, covenant, governance, dossier, test-policy, differential_corpus). The cargo `test` step failed twice with an unrelated linker Bus error in continuum-context's doctests (crates/continuum-context/src/verdict.rs, target.rs) while host swap was fully exhausted (31Gi/31Gi used) — reproduced identically across 2 runs, zero relation to files this bone touched. A full just check run at session start (before this change) passed end to end. Reporting, not masking: recommend the lead re-run just check once host memory pressure clears."}	blake3:CT3GHWpjIu3YhuAwQxgHGRtKiGts_enGAAxY99dwubQ
